@startuml
skinparam dpi 180
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ParticipantPadding 12
title SD03 Official price collection
participant "ProductTab\nSwingWorker" as UI
participant "OnlineCollection\nService" as Service
participant "Online\nCatalog" as Collector
participant "Official website" as Site
participant Repository as Repo
participant TargetService as Target
UI -> Service : 1. collect(automatic, progress)
Service -> Repo : 2. snapshot() / daily guard
note over Service, Repo
Network reads do not lock the ledger.
end note
Service -> Collector : 3. collect(progress)
loop Built-in source catalog
Collector -> Site : 4. bounded HTTPS GET
Site --> Collector : product page / source error
note right of Collector
Validate ID, name, specification,
KRW price, stock and conditions.
end note
Collector --> UI : progress message
end
Collector --> Service : 5. prices / errors
Service -> Repo : 6. snapshot() / merge
Service -> Repo : 7. saveAtomic(candidate)
Repo --> Service : OK / SAVE_FAILED
alt Saved current prices
Service -> Target : 8. EVALUATE(updated products)
Target --> Service : saved alert results
end
Service --> UI : 9. collection results
UI -> UI : refresh related tabs
@enduml

